  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请问～这位客人，\n要不要坐一下出租车呀？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF795EEFF5E8FD94F4D5BA24EBAFF0C000A89814E0D898157504E004E0B51FA79DF8F665440FF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我才刚当上出租车司机，\n还没载过任何人……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624D521A5F534E0A51FA79DF8F6653F8673AFF0C000A8FD86CA18F7D8FC74EFB4F554EBA20262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "倒也不能说是练习，\n但我想习惯一下……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50124E5F4E0D80FD8BF4662F7EC34E60FF0C000A4F46621160F34E6060EF4E004E0B20262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，我不收钱的，\n拜托你当一下我的乘客，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n坐我的出租车吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C62114E0D653694B17684FF0C000A62DC62584F605F534E004E0B621176844E585BA2FF0C00100001BE00000A57506211768451FA79DF8F665427FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么说走就走，\n请你来跟我搭话吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E488BF48D705C318D70FF0C000A8BF74F6067658DDF6211642D8BDD5427FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要坐我的出租车吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60898157506211768451FA79DF8F665417FF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "坐",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要啊……你就当助人为乐，\n坐一下我的出租车吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8981554A202620264F605C315F5352A94EBA4E3A4E50FF0C000A57504E004E0B6211768451FA79DF8F6654273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢！\n你是我的第1号客人哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C22FF01000A4F60662F621176847B2C003153F75BA24EBA54E6FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦中心：蓉粉",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3FF1A84C97C890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不要换个地方？\n我一定会迷路，开不到那边的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D898163624E2A573065B9FF1F000A62114E005B9A4F1A8FF78DEFFF0C5F004E0D523090A38FB976843002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那、那就出发了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3300190A35C3151FA53D14E86FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只能去一个目的地，\n这样的出租车真是令人惊讶吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA80FD53BB4E004E2A76EE76845730FF0C000A8FD96837768451FA79DF8F66771F662F4EE44EBA60CA8BB65427FF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为我能不迷路地开过去的\n只有这一个地方……不好意思。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A621180FD4E0D8FF78DEF57305F008FC753BB7684000A53EA67098FD94E004E2A573065B9202620264E0D597D610F601D3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……最喜欢\n友友乐咖啡馆的草莓挞了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211202620266700559C6B22000A53CB53CB4E50549655619986768483498393631E4E863002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，我只顾着自己说个痛快，\n不好意思。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C621153EA987E774081EA5DF18BF44E2A75DB5FEBFF0C000A4E0D597D610F601D3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "街上的野生宝可梦变多以后，\n出租车也越来越难开了啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88574E0A768491CE751F5B9D53EF68A653D8591A4EE5540EFF0C000A51FA79DF8F664E5F8D8A67658D8A96BE5F004E86554A3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那你肯定要问\n我为什么要当出租车司机对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F6080AF5B9A898195EE000A62114E3A4EC04E4889815F5351FA79DF8F6653F8673A5BF95427FF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我走错路了，这就绕回去。\n不好意思……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118D7095198DEF4E86FF0C8FD95C317ED556DE53BB3002000A4E0D597D610F601D20262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刚才说到我为什么\n要当出租车司机了对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521A624D8BF4523062114E3A4EC04E48000A89815F5351FA79DF8F6653F8673A4E865BF95427FF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到啦。\n宝可梦中心：蓉粉。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n按我们说好的，你不用付钱。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "523055663002000A5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3FF1A84C97C89300200100001BE00000A630962114EEC8BF4597D7684FF0C4F604E0D75284ED894B13002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会付钱",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A4ED894B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我才要谢谢你\n愿意乘坐我的出租车。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624D89818C228C224F60000A613F610F4E5857506211768451FA79DF8F663002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……那怎么行……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但难得你这么说，\n我就收你<U+E300>710吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A3600E4E48884C2026202600100001BE01000A4F4696BE5F974F608FD94E488BF4FF0C000A62115C3165364F60E30000370031003054273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……那怎么行……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但难得你这么说，\n我就收你<U+E300>710吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……那个，\n你的钱不够哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A3600E4E48884C2026202600100001BE01000A4F4696BE5F974F608FD94E488BF4FF0C000A62115C3165364F60E3000037003100305427300200100001BE01000A2026202690A34E2AFF0C000A4F60768494B14E0D591F54E63002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "尝试过载客以后，\n我明白自己有多差劲了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C1D8BD58FC78F7D5BA24EE5540EFF0C000A6211660E767D81EA5DF16709591A5DEE52B24E863002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开车和说话都找不对方向，\n这样怎么能让乘客放心呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F008F66548C8BF48BDD90FD627E4E0D5BF965B95411FF0C000A8FD96837600E4E4880FD8BA94E585BA2653E5FC35462FF1F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我对宝可梦对战很有自信，\n请务必和我交手！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662115BF95B9D53EF68A65BF962185F88670981EA4FE1FF0C000A8BF752A15FC5548C62114EA4624BFF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第1号客人，\n请务必和我对战！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C003153F75BA24EBAFF0C000A8BF752A15FC5548C62115BF96218FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没问题",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA195EE98980000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我显露一下\n自己的优点吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA96211663E97324E004E0B000A81EA5DF176844F1870B954273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和我对战嘛。\n我会让你刮目相看的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C62115BF96218561B3002000A62114F1A8BA94F60522E76EE76F8770B7684FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦对战也是一塌糊涂啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A65BF962184E5F662F4E00584C7CCA6D82554A20262026001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是和你对战，\n明明输了却很开心！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F548C4F605BF96218FF0C000A660E660E8F934E8653745F885F005FC3FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然是因为坚持打宝可梦对战\n让我有了自信吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C7136662F56E04E3A575A630162535B9D53EF68A65BF96218000A8BA9621167094E8681EA4FE154273002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是我也坚持干出租车司机这行，\n一定会培养出自信的！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……能坚持下去的话。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F62114E5F575A63015E7251FA79DF8F6653F8673A8FD9884CFF0C000A4E005B9A4F1A57F9517B51FA81EA4FE17684FF0100100001BE00000A2026202680FD575A63014E0B53BB76848BDD3002001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第1号客人，\n今天谢谢你了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C003153F75BA24EBAFF0C000A4ECA59298C228C224F604E86FF01001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    }
